# Expanded reference validation plan

Status: implemented_pending_expanded_reference. No new quantum-chemical reference calculation was performed during package development.

## Inspected primary evidence

- paper_main, PDF pages [2, 3, 4]: Fig1 complete molecular structures and proposed π/helicity relationship inspected visually; devices kept outside task.
- paper_si, PDF pages [7, 8, 9, 11, 12, 13, 27, 28, 29, 30, 31, 34, 35, 38, 39, 42]: Computational method p7 andVT-NMR discussion pp11–13 inspected. The original138-atomdi graph was transcribed and source stereocenters independently confirmedR; exact three-bond cut/cap reconstruction yielded two equal fullmono formulas.

## Reusable legacy evidence

The originaldi coordinates are private graph/mapping provenance and fixed-energy method context only. No old fixed-point PASS demonstrates TDCD or ensemble spectra. The private legacy_final_snapshot is a byte-for-byte provenance archive, not new completion evidence.

## New reference gaps

Independent starts and fixed-helicity minima, corresponding mono/di TDCD, common-subunit spectra and bounded sidechain ensemble references are not yet calculated.

## Minimum pilot

Validate complete graphs/CIP/backbone signs, then run one di TDCD state window and sign convention test to measure memory/root cost. Freeze a small sidechain search policy after the pilot rather than estimating TD cost from old single points.

## Full expanded validation

Execute the complete public matrix, inspect identities and raw outputs, reproduce all new differences and sensitivity analyses, and independently review the claimed discrimination. Calibrate property-specific method/sampling errors before any numerical acceptance bands. Do not reuse narrow legacy tolerances. Document failed, collapsed and unresolved candidates rather than inventing minima.

## Available route and resource boundary

ORCA/Gaussian TD electric/magnetic/rotatory outputs, Multiwfn and conformer tools; only molecular jobs, no periodic/device calculation. Consult chemistry_toolbox/README.md, config/native_software_manual_profiles.yaml, native_software_docs/gaussian/QUICKSTART.md, orca/EXCITED_STATES.md, crest/CONFORMER_SEARCH.md and goodvibes/QUICKSTART.md as applicable. Listed capabilities are not proof that this expanded system has run. Use inspect_software and validate_native_job before submission. This authoring run did not submit long jobs, HPC work or paid services.
